=== CRITICAL: OUTPUT REQUIREMENTS ===

**ASCII ONLY**: Your output MUST contain ONLY ASCII characters (codes 0-127).
- NO Unicode characters (Chinese, Arabic, emoji, etc.)
- NO special characters outside standard ASCII
- NO non-English text anywhere in the code
- Variable names: a-z, A-Z, 0-9, underscore ONLY
- Strings: Use only ASCII printable characters
- Use RAW STRINGS for regex patterns: r"pattern" not "pattern"

